weeek-mcp bundles work from the following projects.

================================================================================
adalekin/weeek-mcp  (https://github.com/adalekin/weeek-mcp)

The ProseMirror-to-Markdown renderer in src/weeek_mcp/session/prosemirror.py is
derived from the read half of that project's weeek_mcp/kb/prosemirror.py. Its
mapping of Weeek's node vocabulary (flat `list` siblings carrying a `kind`
attribute, `line-break` for soft breaks, `horizontal-line`, and the
table/table_body/table_row/table_cell nesting) was established there by network
capture and is reused here. Image collection and the pluggable image renderer
were added for this project.

